<title>AUSTRALIA: News says Ansett yr results marginally up.</title>
<headline>News says Ansett yr results marginally up.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>News Corp Ltd said on Wednesday results at its 50 percent owned Ansett Airlines in the year to Juine 30, 1997 were marginally above the 1995/96 year.</p>
</text>
